    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK are delighted to present 55 Boroimhe Maples to the market. This beautifully presented two-bedroom mid-terrace home, ideally located in the highly sought-after Boroimhe development in Swords. This inviting property offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout, making it an excellent choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a home in a well-established and convenient location.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a warm and inviting entrance hallway that sets the tone for the rest of the home. The hallway leads into a bright and spacious living room, featuring a charming fireplace that creates a cosy and comfortable setting for relaxing or entertaining guests.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property is a generous kitchen with ample storage and excellent workspace, ideal for modern family living. A separate utility room provides additional practicality and storage. The kitchen enjoys views over the spacious rear garden, which offers a wonderful outdoor space for dining, gardening, or simply enjoying the privacy and tranquillity of the setting.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises two spacious double bedrooms, both filled with natural light and offering comfortable accommodation. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the first-floor layout.\r\n\r\nThe property is further enhanced by designated parking, adding to the convenience of this attractive home.\r\n\r\nBoroimhe is one of Swords’ most popular residential developments, renowned for its family-friendly atmosphere and excellent amenities. The property is within easy reach of Swords Village, Airside retail park and the Pavilions Shopping Centre, which offer a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, and leisure facilities. There are numerous primary and secondary schools nearby, as well as parks, sports clubs, and recreational amenities.\r\n\r\nCommuters will appreciate the superb transport links, with Dublin Airport just minutes away and excellent access to the M1, M50, and Dublin city centre. Regular Dublin Bus services and the nearby Swords Express provide convenient public transport options, making this an ideal location for those seeking both comfort and connectivity.\r\n\r\n55 Boroimhe Maples presents a fantastic opportunity to acquire a well-maintained home in a prime Swords location, combining spacious accommodation, a generous rear garden, and exceptional convenience in one of North Dublin’s most desirable residential areas.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
